<title>SINGAPORE: Datacraft, Racal in partnership.</title>
<headline>Datacraft, Racal in partnership.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Communications and network systems integrator Datacraft Asia Ltd said on Thursday it had been appointed one of Racal Data Group's distributors in Asia.</p>
<p>Racal is part of British Racal Electronics Plc.</p>
<p>It said in a statement Datacraft will market and distribute Racal's line of advanced network communications and security products.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
